  "notes": "{引|ひ}き{出|だ}す is a compound verb meaning to pull/draw out.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Related noun: ⟦{引|ひ}き{出|だ}し→引き出し：01498_hikidashi⟧ (drawer)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- お⟦{金|かね}→金：02618_kane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}き{出|だ}す (withdraw money)\n- ⟦{能力|のうりょく}→能力：03541_nouryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}き{出|だ}す (draw out ability)\n- ⟦{本音|ほんね}→本音：06620_honne⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}き{出|だ}す (draw out true feelings)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Physical: to pull something out\n2. Banking: to withdraw money\n3. Figurative: to elicit, bring out (potential, feelings)",
